Monitoring

`Prometheus` scrapes `API`, `Worker` and `Database`. `Grafana` reads
`Prometheus`, and `Alertmanager` receives alerts from `Prometheus` and pages
the `On-call engineer`.
---
Prometheus -> API, Worker, Database: scrape
Grafana -> Prometheus: read
Prometheus -> Alertmanager: alerts
Alertmanager -> On-call engineer: page
